#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This graph would contain at least {people_count} people, which exceeds the "
"limit of {people_limit} people. For performance reasons, at least "
"{people_missing} people won't be shown. You can change this limit in the "
"view configuration."
msgstr ""
"Esta gráfica contendría la última {people_count} de gente, la cual supera el "
"límite de {people_limit} de gente. Por razones de rendimiento, al menos "
"{people_missing} gente no serían mostradas. Puede cambiar este límite en la "
"configuración de la vista."

